      "writtenOn": "2019-03-05T21:44:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I\u0027m not super familiar with this code, but it looks like blk_try_merge() may be the wrong place to add the front/back mergable checks.  It looks like blk_try_merge() isn\u0027t not always called, and sometimes .elevator_merge_fn() is called instead.  Possibly these checks should go in ll_new_hw_segment() instead?  What was the thinking behind putting the checks here specifically?",
      "revId": "fc8a42830e382302731d7eeb887396bcfccb0a02",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
